  "details": "I have accidentally muted three of my friends while trying to squat in VR. (With seated and standing play modes.) Each time, they are muted for no longer than a second before I un-mute them. They continue to talk normally in that world. Only after someone leaves/loads into a new world does the issue occur. After accidentally muting these people, they always load into my world as muted and they always see me as having muted them, even after I turn their voices back on. I have tried re-loading my game, re-loading worlds, avatars, blocking, un-blocking, everything under the sun and it still has not resolved itself. They can hear me just fine, but I cannot hear them no matter what we try.",
